<title>USA: U.S. hedge funds gain 2.6 pct in Q3 - survey.</title>
<headline>U.S. hedge funds gain 2.6 pct in Q3 - survey.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. hedge funds rose in value by an average 2.6 percent in the third quarter, according to Van Hedge Fund Advisors.</p>
<p>The average offshore hedge fund rose 1.3 percent for the period.</p>
<p>Year to date, through September, the average U.S. hedge fund rose 14.6 percent, while the average offshore hedge fund gained 11.9 percent.</p>
</text>
